Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nexxyz <nexxyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nexxyz/kvm-switcher
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-hid (>= 0.9.0.post3), udev, adduser
Description: fixed KVM Switcher for the validated MSI 491CQPX
 KVM Switcher sends the fixed display and KVM requests for the MSI 491CQPX.
 Only MSI 491CQPX is validated by this project. Other monitor models are
 experimental and untested.
